# App state files. In pinned mode the desktop app writes its state next to
# the data dir (stateDir = dirname(dataDir)), so a launch pointed straight at
# __fixtures__/synthetic drops state here — that's how explorer-preferences.json
# once ended up committed. e2e/helpers.ts launchApp now copies the fixtures to
# a temp dir per run; this guard covers manual launches.
app-preferences.json
ui-preferences.json
explorer-preferences.json
savings-preferences.json
telemetry-outbox.jsonl
baselines.json
baselines-data.json
org-accounts.json
org-account-tags.json
region-names.json
dismissed-suggestions.json
